"""
D3Q19 MRT transformation matrices (orthonormal)
Generated via Gram-Schmidt orthogonalization of monomial basis
with weighted inner product <u,v>_w = sum(w_i * u_i * v_i)

M @ diag(w) @ M^T = I
invM = diag(w) @ M^T

Monomial exponents for each row:
  m 0: x^0y^0z^0
  m 1: x^0y^0z^1
  m 2: x^0y^0z^2
  m 3: x^0y^1z^0
  m 4: x^0y^1z^1
  m 5: x^0y^1z^2
  m 6: x^0y^2z^0
  m 7: x^0y^2z^1
  m 8: x^0y^2z^2
  m 9: x^1y^0z^0
  m10: x^1y^0z^1
  m11: x^1y^0z^2
  m12: x^1y^1z^0
  m13: x^1y^2z^0
  m14: x^2y^0z^0
  m15: x^2y^0z^1
  m16: x^2y^0z^2
  m17: x^2y^1z^0
  m18: x^2y^2z^0
"""

